      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I did not choose the cheapest system, I chose a Sunpower system based on track record and I know the name and history behind the brand.  Unlike many of the other systems currently available where you only have the retailers word that it is a quality system from a reputable manufacturer you have not heard of  and that comes with a warranty that is not worth anything when you need it. Size of roof space came into it also in that with Sunpower I could fit a 3.6 Kwh system with only 12 panels. Most other brands would have not been able to put a 3kwh system into this space as they require at least 18 panels for 3kwh.NQ Solar were only to willing to answer all the questions I had regarding options of brands they offered and the pluses and minuses of each. Extremely happy to recommend them from the salesand admin staff through to the installation crew an easy and painless process. Also the system has produced at the level I was told it would.",
